&amp;lt;input type='radio' name='3' value='blue'&amp;gt;color of mood 
&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;a href='http://aa.ecn.cz/aa/doc/help.html'&amp;gt;?&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;div class=tabhlp&amp;gt;What Color of Mood does this inspire?&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/td&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt;

